# {{BONE_REPO}} - ignore rules
#
# A BONE repository holds knowledge, and knowledge MUST be committable by construction
# (CLAUDE.md invariant 6). This file exists to keep secret-shaped and machine-local files out,
# NOT to hide knowledge. If a class of record cannot be committed, it is not knowledge-repo material
# and it does not belong here at all.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: docs/**, metrics/**, CURATION.md, MANIFEST.yaml, .claude/skills/**,
# .claude/hooks/**, .claude/settings.json. Ignoring any of those breaks decay detection, breaks a
# teammate's clone, and destroys the audit trail.

# --- Secret-shaped -----------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.env.example
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk
.netrc
.npmrc
credentials
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
*.token
.token
*-token
secrets.yml
secrets.yaml
secrets.json
.aws/
.ssh/
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig

# --- Local agent state -------------------------------------------------------
# Personal tooling, machine-specific hooks and permissions live here, never in settings.json.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/local/

# --- Scratch -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Working space that is explicitly not knowledge. Anything here is disposable by definition.
scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

